<title>USA: NationsBank names Billy Payne vice-president.</title>
<headline>NationsBank names Billy Payne vice-president.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank said Thursday that William Porter Payne will join the company as a vice chairman.</p>
<p>Payne, 49, is president and chief executive of the Atlanta Committee for the Olympic games.</p>
<p>The company said he will be responsible for developing relationships with individuals, corporations and institutions and for representing NationsBank in public and private forums throughout the world.</p>
</text>
